                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td class="py-2.5 px-4 font-sans font-semibold text-white">best hotels in addis ababa</td>
                        <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-indigo-400 font-bold">#7</td>
                        <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-emerald-400">▲ +1</td>
                        <td class="py-2.5 px-3">5,400</td>
                        <td class="py-2.5 px-3 text-slate-300">$0.85</td>
                        <td class="py-2.5 px-3 font-sans"><span class="rounded bg-amber-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/20">Commercial</span></td>
                      </tr>
                      <tr>
                        <td class="py-2.5 px-4 font-sans font-semibold text-white">ቡና መግዛት</td>
