          Mainstream global SEO tools overlook Ethiopian search behavior, Amharic Ge’ez script nuances, and the google.com.et SERP index. DoxaRank is engineered specifically for local success.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
